      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The gaps will appear in areas of true subconscious drive, which is messy and non-linear, something algorithms struggle to model authentically. Test them with highly abstract or morally ambiguous hypotheticals that require gut feeling rather than logical processing. Look for a complete inability to express genuine internal conflict or self-doubt; a perfectly rational answer to a deeply emotional prompt is a massive red flag. If the synthetic version always resolves conflict neatly, it is merely executing code, not experiencing the human struggle.",
